      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(e) Provide for the establishment of a corporation with non-governmental as well as governmental representation for the purpose of contracting with the Federal Government for the conduct of operations under the Economic Opportunity Act of 1964, to discharge administrative and operational functions subject to the policy determinations of the New York City Council Against Poverty.",
