        "chars": 752,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.17
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        499,
        1857,
        2210,
        2407
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The mechanism described in this Order is designed to (a) mobilize and concentrate the maximum of both governmental and non-governmental resources; (b) arouse, mobilize and coordinate the directions of citizen effort; and (c) seek, channel and utilize maximum fiscal and other assistance from the Federal and State Governments and from private foundations and other sources of such support for the efforts to be undertaken, for the purposes above stated.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3048,
          "min": -1.5835
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0006
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 86,
          "mean": -0.016,
          "min": -0.8263
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 45953,
        "area_px": 856254,
        "density": 0.05367,
        "chars": 453,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.86
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        488,
        2436,
        2210,
        3258
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In mounting and prosecuting such efforts, chief emphasis is to be given to those undertakings which will: (a) provide training and increase educational and vocational skills and capacities; (b) promote and expand employment opportunities; (c) combat discrimination in all forms and all its effects, especially with regard to education, training, employment and housing; (d) promote constructive and dynamic neighborhood conditions and forces; (e) improve housing conditions; and (f) otherwise stimulate, motivate and channel the energies of the impoverished and socially handicapped, for self-improvement which inevitably result in immeasurable social benefits, including reduction",
